# Oni-Cult Anvil's trigger needs an artifact YOU control leaving DURING YOUR turn. Bot1 plays Strip Mine, casts four Moxen and
# the Anvil. On Bot2's turn 2 Bot1 destroys its own Mox Sapphire with Disenchant: your artifact, but not your turn - no
# Construct. On turn 3 Disenchant on Bot2's Mox Emerald (your turn, not your artifact) and Strip Mine sacrificing itself to
# destroy Bot2's Island (your turn, not an artifact) make none either. Then the Anvil sacrifices itself: it leaves the
# battlefield as an artifact on Bot1's turn, so it sees itself leave (CR 603.10a) and makes the one Construct.

[Bot1 Deck]
Strip Mine
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Oni-Cult Anvil
Disenchant
Disenchant
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Emerald
Plains x20

